# Screenshots Directory

Place application screenshots here for use in documentation.

Recommended screenshots:
- menu.png - Main menu screen
- match.png - Gameplay/match screen
- dashboard.png - Player dashboard
- card_detail.png - Single card close-up
- collection.png - Card collection view
- decks.png - Deck builder screen
- android_landscape.png - Android in landscape orientation
- android_portrait.png - Android in portrait orientation
- desktop.png - Desktop application window

All screenshots should be in PNG format, preferably 1920x1080 or device-native resolution.
